            <a data-custom-class="link" href="#privacyrights"><span style="color: rgb(0, 58, 250); font-size: 15px;">your privacy rights</span></a>.
        </span>
    </span>
            </div>

            <div style="line-height: 1.5;"><br></div>

            <div style="line-height: 1.5;">
    <span style="font-size: 15px;">
