            <a data-custom-class="link" href="https://app.termly.io/dsar/8a87fe20-0055-4711-8d37-b3b569434e93" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(0, 58, 250); font-size: 15px;">data subject access request</span></a>, or by contacting us. We will consider and act upon any request in accordance with applicable data protection laws.
        </span>
    </span>
            </div>

            <div style="line-height: 1.5;"><br></div>

            <div style="line-height: 1.5;">
    <span style="font-size: 15px;">
        <span data-custom-class="body_text">
