            <div style="line-height: 1.5;"><br></div>
            <div style="line-height: 1.5;"><br></div>

            <div id="infocollect" style="line-height: 1.5;">
                <strong><span style="font-size: 15px;"><span data-custom-class="heading_1"><h2>1. WHAT INFORMATION DO WE COLLECT?</h2></span></span></strong>
                <span data-custom-class="heading_2" id="personalinfo"><strong><h3>Personal information you disclose to us</h3></strong></span>
                <span style="color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;">
