        </span>
    </span>
            </div>

            <div style="line-height: 1.5;"><br></div>

            <div id="infouse" style="line-height: 1.5;">
                <strong><span style="font-size: 15px;"><span data-custom-class="heading_1"><h2>2. HOW DO WE PROCESS YOUR INFORMATION?</h2></span></span></strong>
                <span style="color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;">
